t.script:
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {"@type": "Question", "name": "How much does Odoo POS cost in Egypt?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Odoo POS implementation in Egypt starts from basic single-store setup. Multi-store deployments with customization range depending on features needed. XamlTech provides free consultation and custom quotes. The Odoo Community edition POS is free, Enterprise requires licensing. Our custom POS modules (cutting orders, real-time stock, security) are available on the Odoo Apps Store starting from €99."}},
    {"@type": "Question", "name": "Does Odoo POS work offline?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Odoo POS is a Progressive Web App that works offline. When internet is lost, cashiers continue processing orders. All transactions sync automatically when connection returns. XamlTech configures offline mode as part of every POS deployment."}},
    {"@type": "Question", "name": "What hardware do I need for Odoo POS?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Minimum: a tablet or computer with a web browser. For full setup: receipt printer (Epson TM-T20III or Star TSP143), barcode scanner (USB HID), cash drawer (RJ11 connected to printer), and optionally a customer display. Odoo uses IoT Box for printer/device connectivity or direct USB/network printing. XamlTech handles complete hardware procurement and setup."}},
    {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can Odoo POS manage multiple stores?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Odoo POS supports unlimited store locations with centralized management. Each store can have its own pricelist, warehouse, receipt format, and payment methods. Real-time inventory sync across all locations is available with our POS Stock Real-Time module. XamlTech deployed multi-store POS for Al-Ghazl Al-Arabi textile chain."}},
    {"@type": "Question", "name": "Is Odoo POS good for restaurants and cafes?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Odoo POS has built-in restaurant features: floor plans, table management, split bills, kitchen display, tip management. It integrates with Odoo Inventory for ingredient tracking and Accounting for automated daily reconciliation. XamlTech customizes the POS UI, adds loyalty programs, and configures kitchen printing."}},
    {"@type": "Question", "name": "Who installs Odoo POS in Upper Egypt?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "XamlTech, based in Aswan, provides complete Odoo POS installation across Upper Egypt. Services include: software configuration, hardware setup (printers, scanners, cash drawers), staff training, and ongoing support. We have published POS modules on the official Odoo Apps Store."}}
  ]
}
